WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
So that's it

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,000
Congratulations, Uncle You.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,600
That brother Zhang?

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,200
There is really no other way

5
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,460
The fever at home is severe

6
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,460
Can you please give me some medicine?

7
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,260
I still have a few boxes of medicine here.

8
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:21,210
Come and get it later and watch me, Uncle You.

9
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,610
This is your identity

10
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:24,810
In my eyes, we have been acquaintances for many years

11
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,410
You are just like my uncle

12
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:36,160
Come and get the medicine, Zhang Yi

13
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,960
I am Youjiangji

14
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,560
are you at home
